      "creditType": "uncertain",
      "attributionNote": "Kaper’s role in the German version is unresolved. Positive trace: IMDb/SRC0520 (“Benjamin Kapper”). Filmportal/SRC0117 and the Jurmann catalogue/SRC0306 do not confirm it; Hofmeister (July 1931): 152 registers “Du bist nicht die Erste” under Jurmann alone, and production dates to autumn 1930, before the Jurmann–Kaper collaboration began. Kaper’s confirmed credit on the French version (F005) is not evidence for this record.",
